# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# There is intentionally no `/* /index.html 200` catch-all: it returns HTTP 200
# for every non-existent URL, which search engines treat as a soft 404 and may
# index as duplicates of the home page. Unmatched URLs now reach 404.html.
#
# /adm is not rewritten either — Pages normalises a rewrite to /index.html into
# a 308 back to /, which broke the portal. scripts/postbuild.mjs emits
# dist/adm/index.html as a real file instead.
